.ruff_cache/

# Evidence artifacts that are REGENERATED, not authored.
#
# WORKFLOW.md step 1c has all four people run the acceptance harness on their
# own machine. If its output were tracked, four people would each produce a
# different acceptance.json and collide on a file nobody owns - the exact
# conflict the file-ownership rule promises cannot happen.
#
# So the volatile run is ignored, and the citable one lives in
# evidence/reference-run/, generated deliberately with --out and committed once.
evidence/results/acceptance.json
evidence/results/acceptance.md
evidence/results/tmp/
*.wav.tmp

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Exclusive lock held by evidence/mutation_test.py while it edits source.
evidence/.mutation_test.lock
